<title>UK: Laird Group buys Italian component firm.</title>
<headline>Laird Group buys Italian component firm.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Engineering group Laird Group Plc said on Monday that it had acquired an Italian automobile component firm, Fergom srl, for 2.8 million stg in cash.</p>
<p>Fergom, based near Turin, manufactures anti-vibration products.</p>
<p>Fergom's sales for the year to December 31, 1996 amounted to 7.2 million stg.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +91-542 7717</p>
</text>
